01..9.jpg`，可直接喂 H3。\n\n**质检已拆除**（卡通脸比对不准，直接看图验收）。\n\n**自动写提示词（新增）**\n故事只填 `#243` 故事框（整段粘也行），`#261` Qwen 看人物A/人物B/场景 3 张图，按 `#263` 规则写出完整提示词，`#265` 可预览，`#264` 开关=True 时自动采用。\nQwen 跑完会自动卸载模型再采样，不抢显存。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [640, 620], "pos": [-921.65087890625, -120.66867065429688], "id": 105, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [145], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "links": [], "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["8e68664d75d66ce4074c8e2512deb05daead44795cbfed55ba882aaec55b8e40.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [380, 330], "pos": [-511.9223937988281, 647.180908203125], "id": 111, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.37.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"image": true, "upload": true}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [146], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "links": [], "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "color": "#332922", "widgets_values": ["c4e191f737c16627666ad0daf7779d400ffe03e007d933a58083cafcf0f10a89.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "type": "L